# The test bot's plan for The Gilded Mimic (crates/openinn/tests/bot.rs): each day it works down
# this list, doing what it can afford. Around the stairs at (6, 0): a hall running south, the
# taproom to the west with the kitchen and cellar behind it, the dormitory and the shrine to the
# east, the gaming den and the bathhouse to the south, the mushroom garden to the west and the map
# room on the level below. The first day's fourteen lines come first (the tests use them alone).
dig 6 1 hall
dig 6 2 hall
dig 5 1 taproom
dig 5 2 taproom
dig 4 1 taproom
dig 4 2 taproom
dig 3 1 kitchen
dig 2 1 kitchen
dig 3 2 cellar
build 5 1 bar
build 4 2 table               # within two cells of the hearth: a snug corner
build 3 1 hearth
build 3 2 kegs
build 2 1 larder
# Day 2 and on, as money allows: beds, then a dice table for the card sharps (reputation 8).
dig 6 3 hall
dig 7 2 dorm
dig 7 3 dorm
build 7 2 bunk
build 7 3 bunk
dig 5 4 taproom
dig 5 5 den
build 5 5 dicetable
build 4 1 stool               # beside the bar: the regulars' row
# Somewhere to wash for the dwarves (reputation 10) and the delvers (15).
build 6 3 washstand
dig 6 4 hall
dig 7 4 bathhouse
dig 8 4 bathhouse
build 8 4 boiler
build 7 4 tub                 # beside the boiler: a steam room
# Mushrooms, a still and tonic at the bar for the delvers' wounds.
dig 2 2 garden
dig 1 2 garden
dig 2 3 garden
dig 1 3 garden
build 2 2 cistern
build 1 2 mushbed
build 1 3 mushbed
build 2 3 mushbed             # three together: a fairy ring
dig 3 3 cellar
build 3 3 still
# More of the taproom and the den.
dig 5 3 taproom
dig 4 3 taproom
build 5 3 table
build 4 3 table
dig 4 5 den
build 4 5 dicetable           # two side by side: dice in the round
build 6 2 washtub
# The shrine, for the pilgrims (reputation 30).
dig 7 1 shrine
dig 8 1 shrine
dig 9 1 shrine
build 8 1 altar
build 7 1 candles
build 9 1 candles             # two by the altar: candles round the altar
dig 8 2 dorm
dig 8 3 dorm
build 8 2 washstand           # beside the altar: a basin by the altar
build 8 3 bunk
build 5 2 banner              # beside three tables: under the banner
build 5 4 bar
# The map room, on the level below, for the wizards (reputation 25).
build 6 4 stairs
dig 6 4 1 hall
dig 5 4 1 library
dig 4 4 1 library
dig 5 5 1 library
dig 4 5 1 library
build 4 4 1 bookcase
build 5 5 1 bookcase
build 5 4 1 desk              # two bookcases beside it: a hushed corner
build 4 5 1 desk
dig 7 5 bathhouse
build 7 5 tub
dig 4 6 den
build 4 6 cardtable
build 6 1 trophy
dig 9 2 dorm
build 9 2 bed                 # needs feather mattresses from the ledger: the bot never buys them
